  step=2,dige:c497559343f5d9ba
    Assertion:every-crewmate-carries-the,sentence:every crewmate carries the whole ledger and the soul secret — a Cave still hellos as its own key — held not wielded — the Captain alone signs as the soul and a friend admits every mate by its cert
  step=3,dige:1b724bd122ab9b1b
    Assertion:the-on-a-mate,sentence:the ✕ on a mate ejects it — a soul-signed NotGrant:Crew rides the ledger — every other mate drops its row and its key
    Assertion:the-ejected-body-finds,sentence:the ejected body finds itself off the ledger and leaves — a crew of one again with its cert and the soul secret dropped
    Assertion:a-friend-of-the,sentence:a friend of the soul keeps the ejection on its pier — the ejected body is refused at the door even with its old cert while a standing mate still passes
  step=4,dige:6325920d4f6f2d7a
    Assertion:the-helm-passes-by,sentence:the helm passes by flipping two roles — the new Captain hellos as the soul with no key moved — the founder stands down to a fresh key and name — a friend dialling the soul reaches the new Captain
  step=5,dige:8bbe65c4bdddaec2
    Assertion:a-fresh-device-that,sentence:a fresh device that ferried the ledger off any mate resumes the Captaincy by the same flip — every crewmate online falls in line and the three ledgers agree byte for byte
    Assertion:the-soul-secret-a,sentence:the soul secret a Cave holds survives a reload through the crew stash — resume works from any mate after any boot
